      "question": "How have recent changes in supply chain conditions and market balance influenced the trend of core goods prices?",
      "quote": "The movement toward pre-pandemic conditions for this category of inflation in part reflects the resolution of supply chain issues and other supply constraints that had boosted goods prices earlier, and supply\u2013demand conditions in goods markets now appear to be relatively balanced.",
