      "type": "factual",
      "split": "selection",
      "question": "Which specific countries were included in the emerging market economy aggregate used for inflation analysis?",
      "quote": "The emerging market economy (EME) aggregate is the average of Argentina, Brazil, Chile, Colombia, Hong Kong, India, Indonesia, Israel, Malaysia, Mexico, the Philippines, Russia, Saudi Arabia, Singapore, South Korea, Taiwan, Thailand, and Vietnam, weighted by shares of U.S. non-oil goods imports, and begins in May 2017.",
      "page": 46
