      "type": "factual",
      "split": "confirmation",
      "question": "What factors did market participants cite for the significant rise in the broad dollar index since mid-2024?",
      "quote": "Market participants attributed the recent increase in the dollar index to widening gaps of U.S. interest rates over those of major AFEs, the relative strength of the U.S. economy, and political and fiscal developments in some foreign economies. Some market participants also pointed to potential increases in U.S. tariffs on imports as a factor pushing the dollar higher in recent months.",
      "page": 48
